1
00:00:03,401 --> 00:00:11,805
Saved parts wait on the Custom parts page. Open the Goldberg sign again.

2
00:00:11,805 --> 00:00:15,498
Edit tools work on what you select. Click the hanging hole to select it...

3
00:00:15,498 --> 00:00:25,979
...then Mirror. Type the mirror line: the centre of the sign, 12,0 to 12,10.

4
00:00:25,979 --> 00:00:29,314
Now there is a matching hole on the right, exactly the same distance in.

5
00:00:29,314 --> 00:00:34,966
Offset draws a copy a set distance away. 1/2" here, for a border inside the panel.

6
00:00:34,966 --> 00:00:41,410
Pick the rectangle, then click the side to offset to: inside.

7
00:00:41,410 --> 00:00:52,501
Fillet rounds corners. 1/2" radius, All corners on, then pick near a corner.

8
00:00:52,501 --> 00:01:04,314
Measure checks a distance: from hole to hole is 21".

9
00:01:04,314 --> 00:01:19,570
A linear dimension stays on the drawing: two points, then where the line goes.

10
00:01:19,570 --> 00:01:27,169
Move, copy, rotate, array, trim and the rest work the same way: select, pick the tool, follow the prompt.
